     "answer": 0,
     "why": "«Fünfzehn» is 15 and «am Tag» means 'per day'; «des» is just Bavarian for «das».",
     "lesson": "Fünfzehn (15) and fünfzig (50) start the same way; listen for the ending: -zehn is '-teen', -zig is '-ty'."
