     "answer": 1,
     "why": "«Budet dozhd so snegom»: 'there'll be rain with snow', i.e. sleet.",
     "lesson": "Minus dva is the number that sticks, but that's today's temperature; the forecast for tomorrow comes after govoryat, 'they say'."
